          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q. Try and find out all possible times on a 12-hour clock of each of these types.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.139,
            0.794,
            0.192
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 3,
              "bbox": [
                0.118,
                0.139,
                0.794,
                0.192
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_26_table_3.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tr><td>Ans.</td><td>4:44</td><td>2:22</td><td>3:33</td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td>10:10</td><td>11:11</td><td>12:12</td><td>09:09</td></tr><tr><td>12:21</td><td></td><td>05:50</td><td>10:01</td><td>Think of some more!</td></tr></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.209,
            0.571,
            0.227
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q. Find some other dates of this form from the past.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.227,
            0.622,
            0.245
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. 20/04/2004, 20/06/2006, Try for yourself!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.263,
            0.57,
            0.28
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q. Find all possible dates of this form from the past.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.28,
            0.657,
            0.298
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. 01/02/2001, 02/02/2002, Think of some more!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.315,
            0.881,
            0.351
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q. Will any year’s calendar repeat again after some years? Will all dates and days in a year match exactly with that of another year?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.352,
            0.221,
            0.368
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. Yes,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.369,
            0.881,
            0.405
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The calendar repeats itself after 6 years if only one leap year is included in these 6 years. If 2 leap years are included, then it will repeat after 5 years."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.44,
            0.223,
            0.456
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Page no. 64"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.455,
            0.149,
            0.475
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.119,
                0.455,
                0.149,
                0.475
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_26_image_12.jpg",
